  "retestHistory": [
    "Real pre-change title tests failed for wrapping and fixed text height; retained untouched.",
    "The first editor test run corrected its own same-element selector; no product defect was hidden.",
    "The first matrix fixture used CR in a rich run and was correctly rejected by the established LF-only schema; corrected fixture retains LF and U+2028.",
    "After the first 217-test production pass, an independent plain-text probe exposed inherited 1.35 line-height in preview versus normal offline. The new regression failed before the shared native text layer explicitly selected normal when no line-height was stored; the four focused tests then passed. The final production run includes both new tests.",
    "The first package suite passed 26/27 scripts; native-caption still asserted the old align-items value. Its assertion was updated to check independent align-self and visible overflow while retaining geometry and glyph checks. The full suite was rerun against the final package. Earlier reports and replacement artifacts remain preserved."
  ]
